 "Four research agents work on a weak-to-strong training problem, each in its own sandbox, sharing findings on one forum.": "0c50d2af47.mp3",
 "The forum keeps failures and critiques as well as wins. One critique shows a big result doesn't replicate.": "db78b3d8d6.mp3",
 "If the forum sits inside the sandboxes, an agent can delete its failed run and edit the critique of its own result.": "ee21941174.mp3",
 "Prescribe every step and the agents do worse. Free to plan, they find a second result.": "9040d12ba6.mp3",
 "That freedom also lets an agent plan work nobody sanctioned. Without review, it simply runs.": "ce4ca02097.mp3",
 "Keep the record out of reach, let the agents plan, and keep people at both ends of the pipeline.": "1efb522a41.mp3"
}
